wayfaring-stranger.logic-flex-pitch.mid
Copyright 2026 James (Pete) Taylor

This MIDI file is a transcription of the performance in wayfaring-stranger.flac, made by Logic
Pro's Flex Pitch ("Create MIDI Track from Flex Pitch Data") from the 48 kHz original of that
recording on 2026-11-17, and exported unedited as a Standard MIDI File (format 0, 120 bpm, 480
ticks to the quarter). Logic writes its default key, C major, which is not a reading of the
take.

It is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0),
as the recording is: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt it for any purpose, provided you give appropriate credit, link to
the licence and indicate if changes were made. The song itself, Wayfaring Stranger, is
traditional and in the public domain; the licence covers this performance and its
transcription.

The rest of this repository is under the MIT licence (LICENSE at the root); that licence does
not cover this file.
